{
 "_comment": "Item name -> KIND, for the loot board's kind filter. ORDERED and the first match wins, compared case-insensitively against the display name; same matcher as osrs_skill_item_rules. The order is the whole trick: a name that reads as one kind and is another (Rune arrow, Crystal tool seed, Amulet of glory(6), Black mask (8), Rock-shell legs) is claimed by its real kind before the obvious rule can see it. Held against every item name in the cache; the traps are asserted in ItemKindsTest.",
 "_kinds": [
  "Runes",
  "Herbs",
  "Seeds",
  "Bones and ashes",
  "Logs",
  "Ores and bars",
  "Gems",
  "Potions",
  "Ammunition",
  "Weapons",
  "Armour",
  "Hides and leather",
  "Food",
  "Materials",
  "Clues and caskets",
  "Coins and tokens"
 ],
